    "message": "Check two Runs compute at once without depending on their speed\n\nA 30-minute target can now finish before the second Run is submitted, as it did on\nLinux CI. Far targets, cancelled afterwards, show the overlap at any speed; the\n30-minute results are compared on their own.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
